    :printedText """If target player has exactly 10 life, Hidetsugu's Second Rite deals 10 damage to that player."""@en ;
    :oracleText """If target player has exactly 10 life, Hidetsugu's Second Rite deals 10 damage to that player."""@en ;
    :flavorText """Once a mortal ogre, Hidetsugu devoured his demonic patron and transcended mortality in a fit of rage."""@en ;
